@startuml 07-部署拓扑
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
title 部署拓扑：VPS + FRP + 本地 Docker

cloud "公网" {
  [访客 / Agent / 爬虫] as VIS
  [域名 A 记录 → VPS IP] as DNS
}

node "VPS（公网 IP · 年费几十元）" {
  [Nginx :443/80\nSSL 终止（Let's Encrypt 自动续期）] as VN
  [frps :7000\nFRP 服务端（token 鉴权）] as FS
  VN --> FS : 反代 127.0.0.1:8912
}

node "本地机器（家 / 宿舍 · 无公网 IP）" {
  [frpc\n主动外连 VPS:7000] as FC
  [Nginx :127.0.0.1:8912\n只听本机，不对外] as HN
  rectangle "Docker 七容器\nNuxt · Spring Boot · MySQL · Redis · ES · RabbitMQ" as DOC
  FC --> HN
  HN --> DOC
}

[CLI + Playwright] as CLI

VIS --> DNS
DNS --> VN
FS <--> FC : FRP 隧道（transport.tls）
CLI --> VN : 同机 localhost:8912 / 异地走域名

note right of FS
  **安全基线**
  frps token 非默认
  VPS 防火墙只放 80 / 443 / 7000
  7500 dashboard 绑 127.0.0.1
end note

note bottom of HN
  **可用性诚实声明**
  家庭断网 / 断电 = 站点下线；
  演示走 localhost:8912，VPS 只做邮差不存数据
end note

@enduml
